English dictionary is generated from Android LatinIME/AOSP word lists
(Apache-2.0, original notices retained) and wordfreq 3.1.1 English frequency
data (CC-BY-SA-4.0). Transformation: scripts/dict/wordfreq_combined.py combines
entries, preserves AOSP frequencies, adjusts apostrophe pairs, and filters
likely misspellings, with a 250000-entry cap. The resulting combined dictionary
is distributed under CC-BY-SA-4.0 with attribution to AOSP contributors and
Robyn Speer/wordfreq contributors. Original input URLs/revisions/checksums
are in assets.lock.json; wordfreq source and attribution/license information:
https://github.com/rspeer/wordfreq and https://pypi.org/project/wordfreq/3.1.1/.
Optional evaluation data, n-gram and neural reranking models are not included.
